    "changes": [
      "Clarifies compact candidate-conditioned tokens and a separate expert-matched dense decoder. Stage1 jointly adapts; Stage2 freezes encoder/adapters/proposal/dense decoder/EMA and assigns future reconstruction loss weight zero.",
      "NAVSIM-v2 table changes reported EPDMS87.7 to89.2; v3 additionally describes corrected evaluation plus training-free temporal consistency reranking (0.875 learned utility+0.125 aligned previous/current trajectory consistency). Do not present this as an isolated model gain under identical protocol.",
      "Adds Bench2Drive results: driving score59.04, success rate24.66%, comfortness14.64, averageL2 0.95m. Metric/baseline conditions must be retained.",
      "Adds forward-pass timing at32 candidates37.24ms vs DiffusionDrive24.68ms andDrivoR295.56ms; this is forward pass, not measured full driving stack latency."
    ],
